  "title": "CJP Protest Over Election Commission Resignation in Delhi",
  "summary": "The Congress for the Progressive Movement (CJP) has staged a protest demanding the immediate resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, with demonstrators including political leaders and civil society figures. The protest took place near Jantar Mantar in Delhi, highlighting ongoing political tensions and the need for judicial oversight.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The CJP has called for the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar in Delhi to address allegations of electoral irregularities and voter rights.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Abhijeet Dipke, a key figure in the CJP, has emphasized that his illness will not hinder the movement's progress.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The protest, led by Abhijeet Dipke and other figures, highlights ongoing tensions between the government and the CJP.",
      "confidence": 0.95
